CLKC-5#1 Advisory
BUFGCE with constant CE has BUFG driver  
The BUFGCE cell jcl_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clk_out2_BUFGCE_collapsed_inst jcl_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clk_out2_BUFGCE_collapsed_inst/I pin (and CE pin not ACTIVE) is driven by BUFGCE clock buffer jcl_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clkout2_buf. This may be an unnecessary use of multiple clocking resources and should be reviewed. Cascaded buffers introduce skew that can lead to difficult or impossible timing closure.
Related violations: <none>


